<title>USA: U.S. SOYOIL WEEKLY EXPORT SALES HIGHLIGHTS--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. SOYOIL WEEKLY EXPORT SALES HIGHLIGHTS--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 20,900 MT were the result of increases for unknown destinations (8,900 MT), Hong Kong (6,900 MT), and Mexico (5,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 2,000 MT were to Canada (1,100 MT) and Jamaica (900 MT) .</p>
